    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="006e4622-b486-5672-a191-5aefce279697" activityNameId="6368ee23-976b-5a03-b8b5-162761e13c73" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Operation, barge</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Operation, barge
Emission data is directly linked to the fuel  consumption. The specific fuel consumption takes into account difference in the  load capacity classes. An average specific emission factor is derived by using the total maximal load capacity as allocation factor. ;
UUID: e6b6033c-5ab1-3626-aa90-5bcaa2a0783d
The inventory includes the supply of fuel (diesel). Direct airborne emissions of gaseous substances, particulate matters, dioxins, PAHs,  halogens and heavy metals are accounted for. Also, the disposal of bilge oil  is included. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Motorboats and push tugs used for solid goods transportation are accounted for
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature studies, international statistics for the Rhine-shipping and own estimates 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e6b6033c-5ab1-3626-aa90-5bcaa2a0783d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
